  "2026-11-03T21:20:19.362Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check: the create-time detector matched pm-pllp78 (GH-1591, the ownership guard fix, closed). This item is not a recurrence of that defect: the guard stays as shipped, and this asks for a new journaled step type the guard can attribute. pm search for 'finalization commitItemMutations' found only the closed bulk-helper lineage (pm-xm7c, pm-y9hq)."
